Subject: [PATCH] fix(entities): translate fish, paddles, and minecart displays

Bedrock sends tropical fish colors and pattern, boat paddle times, and minecart display state as independent actor data. Combine partial updates from stored metadata and emit the Java fields that drive their native renderers. Keep this deferred alongside the existing entity metadata PR.
---
